    {
      "title": "Creatures",
      "groups": [
        {
          "title": "Guard (porter)",
          "about": {
            "kind": "creature",
            "id": "porter"
          },
          "statements": [
            {
              "kind": "creature",
              "about": {
                "kind": "creature",
                "id": "porter"
              },
              "sentence": "Guard (porter) is a dnd5e:monsters:guard of the faction `watch`, standing at q 3, r 0 in Hall (region-hall), facing s.",
              "path": "room.room.monsterDeclarations[0]",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "faction",
                  "id": "watch",
                  "role": "member-of"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "creature.routine",
              "about": {
                "kind": "creature",
                "id": "porter"
              },
              "sentence": "Guard (porter) runs the routine `porter-policy` (as `policy`).",
              "path": "room.room.monsterBindings.porter.behaviors[0]",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "routine",
                  "id": "porter-policy",
                  "role": "uses"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "line",
              "about": {
                "kind": "creature",
                "id": "porter"
              },
              "sentence": "The speaker can say the line “We're expected.” (`guest`) to Guard (porter). It is a plain line: it rolls nothing, cannot be missed, and costs nothing on either clock.",
              "path": "room.room.monsterBindings.porter.options[0]",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "creature",
                  "id": "porter",
                  "role": "said-to"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "line.requires",
              "about": {
                "kind": "creature",
                "id": "porter"
              },
              "sentence": "The line “We're expected.” (`guest`) is offered to a speaker only while the conversation `gate` is in the state `fresh` (one state for the whole run, not per speaker).",
              "path": "room.room.monsterBindings.porter.options[0].requires[0]",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "conversation",
                  "id": "gate",
                  "role": "asks"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "line.advance",
              "about": {
                "kind": "creature",
                "id": "porter"
              },
              "sentence": "Said to Guard (porter), the line “We're expected.” (`guest`): winning it steps the conversation `gate` with the beat `admitted`, which moves it from `fresh` to `admitted` (the line is offered only in `fresh`).",
              "path": "room.room.monsterBindings.porter.options[0].advance",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "conversation",
                  "id": "gate",
                  "role": "advances"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "line.row",
              "about": {
                "kind": "creature",
                "id": "porter"
              },
              "sentence": "When the line “We're expected.” (`guest`) is said, Guard (porter) answers “In you go.”",
              "path": "room.room.monsterBindings.porter.options[0].success[0]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Conversations",
      "groups": [
        {
          "title": "Conversation `gate`",
          "about": {
            "kind": "conversation",
            "id": "gate"
          },
          "statements": [
            {
              "kind": "conversation",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "The conversation `gate` has one state for the whole run, shared by every speaker and every carrier; it starts in `fresh`. Its carriers, the creatures whose lines read or step it, are Guard (porter). Its recipe is `site:interactions:gate`.",
              "path": "interactions.gate",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "creature",
                  "id": "porter",
                  "role": "carries"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "conversation.approach",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "When a character's own step ends within 2 cells of a carrier who sees them and whom they see, both up and out of a fight, and that carrier offers them a line that steps `gate`, the nearest such carrier (then by id) hails them and hears the beat `approached`, unless `gate` is already addressing someone. A line that only reads `gate` does not hail. It is opened within 2 cells, and stands while the other conditions hold and the character is within Speak reach of that carrier (never less than 2 cells); it ends when any fails.",
              "path": "interactions.gate.approach"
            },
            {
              "kind": "conversation.hailers",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "Who can hail for `gate`, by its state: in `fresh`, Guard (porter) (by `guest`); in `admitted`, nobody.",
              "path": "interactions.gate.approach",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "creature",
                  "id": "porter",
                  "role": "carries"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "conversation.state",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "In the state `fresh`, the conversation `gate` listens for 1 beat.",
              "path": "interactions.gate.recipe.states.fresh"
            },
            {
              "kind": "conversation.transition",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "In the state `fresh`, the beat `admitted` moves the conversation to `admitted` (“let through”). The beat is sent by saying `guest` to Guard (porter).",
              "path": "interactions.gate.recipe.states.fresh.transitions[0]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "conversation.state",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "The state `admitted` of `gate` is final: once entered, nothing moves the conversation again.",
              "path": "interactions.gate.recipe.states.admitted"
            },
            {
              "kind": "conversation.asked",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "The line `guest` said to Guard (porter) is offered only while `gate` is in `fresh`.",
              "path": "room.room.monsterBindings.porter.options[0].requires[0]",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "creature",
                  "id": "porter",
                  "role": "carries"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "conversation.engine-rule",
              "about": {
                "kind": "conversation",
                "id": "gate"
              },
              "sentence": "Engine rule, not authored: a reply sent from a menu offered before `gate` last changed (a state change, or a roll beginning or ending its wait on it) is refused with nothing spent; the speaker must be offered the menu again.",
              "path": "(engine rule)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Routines",
      "groups": [
        {
          "title": "Routine `porter-policy`",
          "about": {
            "kind": "routine",
            "id": "porter-policy"
          },
          "statements": [
            {
              "kind": "routine",
              "about": {
                "kind": "routine",
                "id": "porter-policy"
              },
              "sentence": "The routine `porter-policy` is run by Guard (porter); it starts in the state `ready`; its recipe is `site:behaviors:porter-policy`. When it acts from a set of rows, one row whose conditions hold is picked by weight.",
              "path": "behaviorDefinitions.porter-policy",
              "connects": [
                {
                  "kind": "creature",
                  "id": "porter",
                  "role": "runs"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "routine.state",
              "about": {
                "kind": "routine",
                "id": "porter-policy"
              },
              "sentence": "In the state `ready`, Guard (porter) listens for 1 beat.",
              "path": "behaviorDefinitions.porter-policy.recipe.states.ready"
            },
            {
              "kind": "routine.wake",
              "about": {
                "kind": "routine",
                "id": "porter-policy"
              },
              "sentence": "In the state `ready`, when Guard (porter) hails a character, which happens only under the conversation's hail rule: the character's own step ended within the approach distance, Guard (porter) sees them and they see Guard (porter), Guard (porter) offers them a line that steps the conversation, no nearer carrier qualifies, and the conversation is addressing no one, Guard (porter) acts from its own `approached` rows.",
              "path": "behaviorDefinitions.porter-policy.recipe.states.ready.transitions[0]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "routine.row",
              "about": {
                "kind": "routine",
                "id": "porter-policy"
              },
              "sentence": "`approached` row 1 of `porter-policy`: Guard (porter) says “Halt there. What's your business?”",
              "path": "behaviorDefinitions.porter-policy.table.approached[0]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
